[50.652692, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe base case needs to reduce `m + 0` to `m`, and the inductive step needs the inductive hypothesis plus the identity `m + S n' = S (m + n')`. I’ll complete the\r\nproof using standard arithmetic lemmas and compile it.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat <<'EOF' > plus_comm.v\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\n\r\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n  n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    apply plus_n_O.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    rewrite plus_n_Sm.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc plus_comm.v\r\nls -l plus_comm.v plus_comm.vo\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
