[57.533783, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe file now compiles to `plus_comm.vo`. I’ll verify the compiled theorem can be imported and has no remaining assumptions or admitted proofs.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat <<'EOF' > verify_plus_comm.v\r\nRequire Import plus_comm.\r\nCheck plus_comm.\r\nPrint Assumptions plus_comm.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc verify_plus_comm.v\r\ngrep -nE 'admit|Abort' plus_comm.v && exit 1 || echo 'No admits or aborts found.'\r\nrm -f verify_plus_comm.v verify_plus_comm.vo verify_plus_comm.glob verify_plus_comm.vok verify_plus_comm.vos\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
